
	SUBC BUILD STATUS


	=== Cross-Compilation Build System (2025-12-23) ===

	SubC now uses a simplified build system for cross-compilation.
	No configure script needed - just run 'make'.

	Build:
		make            Build the cross-compiler
		make help       Show available make targets
		./src/scc0 -L   List available compilation targets
		./src/scc0 -T <target> -S file.c   Compile for target

